-- DICT-SEMANTICS §6.2 "T4 implemented" at a nested `requires` prerequisite whose
-- instances live in an imported module.  `match def` with `Some _`/`None` arms
-- fixes `def : Option ?a`, which selects `impl Def (Option a) requires Def a` and
-- poses `Def ?a`; `Def Int`, `Def Bool` and `Def (Option b)` all reach it with no
-- stable minimum.  Hand-derived: REJECT on all three verbs, T-AMBIGUOUS-INSTANCE
-- at the `def` occurrence.
import lib.{Def, def}
main = match def
  Some _ => println "some"
  None => println "none"
